Attributions
------------

lucy is a from-scratch rewrite. Its design is informed by the following
projects; no source code or substantial text from them is included in this
repository at this time.

  firstmate      https://github.com/kunchenguid/firstmate
                 Copyright (c) 2026 Kun Chen. MIT License.
  treehouse      https://github.com/kunchenguid/treehouse
                 Copyright (c) 2026 kunchenguid. MIT License.
  no-mistakes    https://github.com/kunchenguid/no-mistakes
                 Copyright (c) 2026 Kun Chen. MIT License.

lucy adopts concepts, resource kinds and schemas from the ai-sdlc
specification, pinned at commit b56cecaeef256644c3066fae2106af5c7eaa684a:

  ai-sdlc        https://github.com/ai-sdlc-framework/ai-sdlc
                 Apache License, Version 2.0.

Any MIT-licensed code copied from the projects above will carry its
copyright and permission notice in a section below.

Vendored files
--------------

The following files are copied unmodified from the ai-sdlc specification
(https://github.com/ai-sdlc-framework/ai-sdlc) at commit
b56cecaeef256644c3066fae2106af5c7eaa684a and remain under the Apache
License, Version 2.0. The upstream repository ships no NOTICE file.
internal/spec/schemas/ai-sdlc/PROVENANCE lists each file with its source
path and SHA-256.

  internal/spec/schemas/ai-sdlc/v1alpha1/*.json
                 the core resource schemas, the shared definitions and the
                 audit entry schema (spec/schemas)
  internal/audit/testdata/audit-chain/
                 the cross-SDK audit chain fixture and sample chains
                 (conformance/audit-chain)
  internal/spec/testdata/examples/*.yaml
                 the spec's resource examples, sections 5.1.3 to 5.5.3 of
                 spec/spec.md, copied verbatim
